--      (ORDER BY batchid DESC) and reuses its batch id (no increment). Fails if
--      no entry exists, status <> 'Completed', or reccnt = 0.
--   2. Fails if the deploy temp table (DEPLY_DTVNTRT_MRA_STG) is empty.
